  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility study 2024 FIF-NCEASL Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Purpose of this intervention is a feasibility study in coming working areas subject to an application for a Forb project 2024.  The two partners aims to have closer talks on the subject based on evaluation, situation presence, possibilities ahead, and concrete working areas towards solution and improvement on the Forb situation in Sri Lanka. Participant will be 2 persons from leadership and working group in FIF Denmark, and the main leaders from the working group of religious liberty commission of NCEASL.  This includes Gen Sec, Head of Religious Liberty, Head of finance and Project Minor Matters, all of NCEASL. Main activities will be a 2-3 days workshop, visits in the districts of work, talks to beneficiaries , Close up and evaluation. The outcome will be to work on a 2 years intervention of a new Forb project.</narrative>
  </description>
